# Web app environment (Vite). Copy to .env for a local override; the dev
# default when unset is http://localhost:4000 (see src/lib/api.ts).
#
# In production this is a BUILD-time value, inlined into the JS bundle:
# set it in the web host's environment (Vercel -> Settings -> Environment
# Variables -> Production) and redeploy after any change. A build without it
# is the "Cannot reach the API at http://localhost:4000" failure. No secrets
# belong here — anything VITE_-prefixed ships to the browser.
#
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api-host
